[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/starfall-light.png" id="3_icon"]

; A drizzle of falling stars round the player, aimed at nothing (scripts/Starfall.cs).
;
; BaseDamage is ONE STAR, on everything inside its landing. BaseProjectileCount is the stars one
; cooldown lets fall - not at once: the cooldown is a cloudburst, and Starfall spreads its stars across
; the next interval, so 4 stars on a 1.0 s cooldown is a steady four a second. BaseRange is the rain's
; radius round the player. The landing radius is Starfall.BaseStarRadius (28 px) plus the AreaSize
; lines below (Effect 7, in pixels), times the player's Area and every milestone's AreaMultiplier.
;
; Written out in full so Player.EnsureRelevantLevelUps generates nothing of its own: every level adds
; 1 damage, even levels take the cooldown step every spell gets and add a star (2, 6, 8) or widen the
; rain (4), odd levels widen each landing by 3 px. Level 8: 12 damage, 7 stars every 0.68 s (10.3 a
; second), 37 px landings over a 210 px rain.

